      "content": "the \"new path\" feels... impossible. i've tried everything. vacations, therapy, stepping back a little bit. nothing changes the fact that i'm just a machine that produces results for people who don't even know me. the exhaustion isn't even physical anymore, it's just this constant, crushing weight. like there's no version of the future where this weight actually goes away.",
